    "abstract": "[Paraphrase] PP-FormulaNet is a formula recognition model that converts mathematical expressions in document images into structured symbolic formats such as LaTeX. It comes in two variants: PP-FormulaNet-L for accuracy, reported to beat UniMERNet by about 6%, and PP-FormulaNet-S for speed, reported to run over 16 times faster. A Formula Mining System extracts large volumes of high-quality formula data to improve robustness. Code and models are released through PaddleOCR and PaddleX."
