    "abstract": "[Paraphrase] Trae Agent is presented as the first agent-based ensemble reasoning approach for repository-level issue resolution. It treats the task as an optimal solution search problem and uses modular agents for patch generation, pruning and selection. Across three LLMs on SWE-bench it improves Pass@1 by 10.22% on average over four ensemble baselines and ranks first on the SWE-bench Verified leaderboard at 75.20%. The project is open source."
